SUMMARY:Wake\, get ready\, log on
DESCRIPTION:End-state wake time — pairs with the 11:30-11:45 PM bedtime t
 arget for ~7 hours. If you're still on the bedtime ramp (ask: is lights-ou
 t reliably before 12:30 AM yet?)\, wake stays 7:00 AM until the ramp is do
 ne — don't force an earlier wake before the sleep debt is repaid.\n\nMON
 DAY NOTE: check whether this is your laundry week (separate all-day marker
 ) — if so\, start a load before you sit down to work.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8f96a657-9cbd-493a-ade5-ec7be88415b4@family-os
