DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260706T100000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
SUMMARY:WFH work block
DESCRIPTION:Deep work / meetings from home. Default: Shraddha owns the 8:00
 -9:00 AM Ahana block while you work straight through.\n\nTWO MORNINGS A WE
 EK (decided fresh at the Sunday Weekly Reset\, not fixed to specific days)
 : you shift this block to start at 8:00 AM instead and take the 8-9 Ahana 
 block yourself\, so the default doesn't silently calcify into "Shraddha al
 ways does mornings." Check this week's decision before assuming.
END:VEVENT
