BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b45a243e-0f9f-4910-9cc8-79540263559f@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260706T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260706T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Tadka Dal + Aloo Gobi + Rice (
 Week 1)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: reheat Sunday's batch dal (1 cup toor dal base) with 
 a fresh tempering — 1 tbsp ghee\, 1 tsp cumin seeds\, 2 crushed garlic c
 loves\, 1 dried red chili\, pinch hing\; pour over dal\, simmer 3 min.\nAl
 oo gobi: 2 cups cauliflower florets + 2 medium potatoes\, cubed. Heat 2 tb
 sp oil + 1 tsp cumin seeds\, add potato/cauliflower\, 1/2 tsp turmeric\, 1
  tsp coriander powder\, 1/2 tsp red chili powder\, salt. Cover\, cook 12-1
 5 min\, stir occasionally\, finish with cilantro.\nServe over Sunday's bat
 ch rice. Ahana: her portion aside before final chili.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b7c4a534-0d2f-45b3-8f28-5f7f8d8fae60@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260713T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260713T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Chana Dal + Bhindi Fry + Rice 
 (Week 2)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Chana dal — 1 cup chana dal\, Instant Pot Manual 12
  min + natural release\, with 3 cups water\, 1/2 tsp turmeric\, salt. Temp
 er: 1 tbsp oil\, 1 tsp cumin\, 1 chopped onion\, 1 tomato\, 1/2 tsp red ch
 ili powder — cook till soft\, mix in\, simmer 5 min.\nBhindi fry: 3 cups
  sliced okra\, saute uncovered in 2 tbsp oil\, medium-high\, 12-15 min\, w
 ith 1/2 tsp turmeric\, 1 tsp coriander powder\, salt\, until crisp-edged (
 uncovered keeps it from getting slimy).\nServe with rice. Ahana: her porti
 on aside before final chili.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7fe22b63-16f2-485e-9a52-db502ed03ff9@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260720T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260720T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Moong Dal + Baingan Bharta + R
 oti (Week 3)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Moong dal — 1 cup split moong dal\, Instant Pot Man
 ual 6 min + quick release\, 1/2 tsp turmeric\, salt\, 3 cups water. Temper
 : 1 tbsp ghee\, 1 tsp cumin\, pinch hing\, 1 chopped tomato — mix in.\nB
 aingan bharta: roast 1 large eggplant whole (air fryer 400F\, 25 min) unti
 l soft\, peel\, mash. Saute 1 chopped onion\, 2 cloves garlic\, 1 tomato i
 n 2 tbsp oil\, add mashed eggplant\, 1/2 tsp turmeric\, 1/2 tsp red chili 
 powder\, salt\, cook 8 min.\nServe with fresh roti. Ahana: her portion asi
 de before final chili.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b51e67e7-088f-4427-bc5f-8696edc0e7ab@family-os
