DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260727T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260727T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=MO
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Rajma + Jeera Rice (Week 4)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Rajma — 1 cup rajma (soaked overnight\, or canned &
  drained)\, Instant Pot Manual 20 min soaked / 8 min canned + natural rele
 ase\, with 1 chopped onion\, 1 tomato\, 1 tbsp ginger-garlic paste\, 1 tsp
  rajma masala or garam masala\, salt\, 2.5 cups water.\nJeera rice: 2 cups
  basmati rice — saute 1 tbsp ghee + 1 tsp cumin seeds first\, then cook 
 rice as usual (rice cooker) with the cumin-ghee mixed in.\nAhana: her port
 ion aside before final chili.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:3c021ef7-7160-4c18-887d-d549657c421b@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260707T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260707T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Sambar + Rice + Beans Poriyal 
 (Week 1)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Sambar — reheat 1.5 cups leftover dal base\, add 1 
 cup mixed vegetables (drumstick\, carrot\, pumpkin — whatever's on hand)
 \, 2 tbsp sambar powder\, 1 tbsp tamarind paste\, salt. Simmer 10 min. Tem
 per: 1 tbsp oil\, 1/2 tsp mustard seeds\, curry leaves\, 2 dried red chili
 es — pour over.\nBeans poriyal: 2 cups chopped green beans\, saute/steam
  8 min with 1 tbsp oil\, 1/2 tsp mustard seeds\, curry leaves\, 2 tbsp gra
 ted coconut\, salt.\nServe with rice. Ahana: her portion aside before fina
 l tempering.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:caae3bef-00b2-4a1b-9bd4-d0fde70da1b7@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260714T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260714T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Rasam + Rice + Cabbage Poriyal
  (Week 2)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Rasam — 2 tbsp cooked toor dal mashed + 2 cups wate
 r\, 1 tbsp rasam powder\, 1 tbsp tamarind paste\, 1 chopped tomato\, salt.
  Simmer 10 min. Temper: 1 tsp mustard seeds\, curry leaves\, pinch hing in
  1 tbsp ghee — pour over\, finish with cilantro.\nCabbage poriyal: 3 cup
 s shredded cabbage\, saute 8 min with 1 tbsp oil\, 1/2 tsp mustard seeds\,
  2 tbsp grated coconut\, salt.\nServe with rice. Ahana: her portion aside 
 before final tempering.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1c6da6de-4fd9-4435-8aa3-a4d94d1c35e4@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260721T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260721T193000
RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Vegetable Kurma + Idli (Week 3
 )
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: Kurma — saute 1 chopped onion\, 1 tbsp ginger-garli
 c paste in 2 tbsp oil\, add 2 cups mixed vegetables (carrot\, beans\, pota
 to\, peas)\, 1/2 cup coconut-cashew paste (blend 3 tbsp grated coconut + 5
  cashews + water)\, 1 tsp garam masala\, salt\, 1 cup water — simmer cov
 ered 12 min.\nServe with steamed idli (store-bought batter is fine).\nAhan
 a: her portion aside before final spice.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:32f0d98b-678a-4ca3-9074-8ff97ddbd12b@family-os
