RRULE:INTERVAL=4;FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TH
SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Dal Paratha\, ~10 min (Week 1)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT (leftover remix): mix 1 cup leftover thick dal with 1.
 5 cups whole wheat flour\, 1/2 tsp ajwain\, salt\, a splash of water — k
 nead into a soft dough. Roll into 6 parathas\, cook on a hot tawa with 1/2
  tsp ghee each side until golden spots appear. Serve with yogurt/pickle.\n
 Ahana: a plain paratha\, no pickle\, torn into small pieces.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
