SUMMARY:Family block\, no phones — Dinner: Fried Rice\, ~10 min (Week 2)
DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT (leftover remix): 3 cups leftover rice\, 1 cup diced m
 ixed vegetables (frozen is fine) — saute vegetables in 2 tbsp oil 4 min\
 , push aside\, scramble in 2 eggs or extra tofu cubes\, mix in rice\, 2 tb
 sp soy sauce\, 1/2 tsp black pepper\, toss 3-4 min on high heat.\nAhana: a
  plain portion set aside before the soy sauce goes in.
END:VEVENT
