 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT (leftover remix): blend or mash 1.5 cups leftover dal 
 with 1 cup vegetable broth or water to soup consistency\, reheat with a sq
 ueeze of lemon and black pepper. Toast 4 slices bread with butter. Done in
