DESCRIPTION:Dinner (~6:30) + floor play or books\, her pick. Phone physical
 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: heat a tawa\, pour a ladle of batter — spread thin 
 for dosa\, or leave thick with chopped onion/tomato pressed in for uttapam
 . Cook 2-3 min per side with a little oil. Serve with sambar (Tuesday's le
 ftovers\, if any) and coconut chutney (store-bought is fine).\nAhana: a so
 ft\, plain uttapam piece\, torn small.
END:VEVENT
