 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: boil 300g pasta per package instructions. Sauce: saut
 e 1 chopped onion + 3 cloves garlic in 2 tbsp olive oil\, add 1 cup jarred
  marinara + 1 cup chopped vegetables (zucchini\, bell pepper\, spinach)\, 
 simmer 8 min\, salt + chili flakes to taste. Toss with pasta\, top with gr
 ated cheese.\nAhana: her portion before the chili flakes go in.
