 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: toss 300g paneer cubes in 2 tbsp yogurt\, 1 tbsp ging
 er-garlic paste\, 1 tsp tikka masala\, salt — air fryer 400F\, 10 min\, 
 shake at 5 min. Side salad: cucumber\, tomato\, onion\, lemon juice\, salt
 .\nAhana: plain paneer cubes set aside before the masala marinade.
