 ly out of the room. Narrate\, expand her sentences\, offer one real choice
 .\n\nDINNER TONIGHT: pan-fry 4 frozen parathas with a little ghee/oil per 
 package instructions\, 2-3 min per side. Serve with fresh curd/yogurt and 
 pickle. Zero-effort Friday\, by design.\nAhana: plain paratha piece + plai
 n curd\, no pickle.
END:VEVENT
