DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260707T220000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU,TH
SUMMARY:Strength — apartment gym (empty hours)
DESCRIPTION:30 min routine:\n- Goblet squats or leg press (moderate depth 
 — knee history) 3x10\n- Rows 3x10\n- Incline push-ups or chest press (sk
 ip overhead pressing early — clavicle history) 3x10\n- Carries or planks
 \, 3 rounds\n\nHARD RULES: never start later than 9:45. Out by 10:15. This
  replaces screen time\, never sleep. GATE: only once your bedtime ramp is 
 reliably <= 12:30 AM — until then this slot is just quiet time\, not the
  gym.
END:VEVENT
