DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260718T130000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=3SA
SUMMARY:Monthly Learning Share (3rd Saturday)
DESCRIPTION:1 hour\, nap window\, both of you. Each of you shares the most 
 useful thing you learned that month (from your two weekly 45-min work-hour
 s learning blocks\, or the quarterly AI-tooling project). This doubles as 
 marriage maintenance — a conversation that isn't logistics. No prep need
 ed beyond having paid attention during the month.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
