BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:6dbd5364-37b2-4095-978c-cffaccdb9180@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T113000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;INTERVAL=2;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Costco run (biweekly)
DESCRIPTION:BULK LIST — starting quantities\, adjust after a couple of tr
 ips based on what actually runs out:\n- Rice: one 20 lb bag\n- Lentils: 4 
 lb toor dal\, 2 lb chana dal\, 2 lb moong dal\, 2 lb masoor dal\n- Quinoa:
  3 lb bag\n- Frozen mixed vegetables: 2 large bags\n- Tofu: 2 blocks (14 o
 z each)\n- Greek yogurt: 2 large tubs (32 oz)\n- Paneer: 2 lb\n- Nuts/seed
 s: 1 mixed bag (almonds\, walnuts\, chia\, flax)\n- Oil: 1 bottle olive oi
 l\, 1 bottle avocado oil\n- Plant protein powder: 1 tub\n- Oats: 1 large c
 anister\n\nThe list is the list — impulse items wait for the next trip. 
 Check Ahana's diaper/wipe Subscribe & Save here too if it hasn't auto-trig
 gered.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
