DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T154500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T160000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Robot vacuum maintenance
DESCRIPTION:Empty the bin\, rinse/replace mop pads — right before the bat
 ch cook\, same trip to the kitchen.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4fa276b1-73ae-467a-a8db-7e6f57acacb8@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T173000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Sunday Batch Cook — you own this end-to-end
DESCRIPTION:Groceries-to-containers\, not "helping." Zero decisions\, quant
 ities inline — the SEQUENCE is the invariant\, not the clock\; things fi
 nish when they finish.\n\nFIRE ALL THREE (first 10 min\, any order):\n1. I
 nstant Pot: 1 cup toor dal (rinsed) + 3 cups water + 1/2 tsp turmeric + 1/
 2 tsp salt -> Manual/Pressure Cook 10 min\, natural release. (If this Tues
 day's dinner event says Sambar: use 3/4 cup dal + 3 cups water + 2 cups ch
 opped veg\, Manual 8 min instead.)\n2. Rice cooker: 3 cups rice\, rinsed\;
  water to the cooker's own 3-cup line. Start.\n3. Air fryer: EITHER 14 oz 
 tofu cubes tossed in 2 tbsp yogurt + 1 tbsp ginger-garlic paste + 1 tsp ch
 ili powder + 1/2 tsp turmeric + 1 tsp garam masala + 3/4 tsp salt + 1 tbsp
  oil -> 400F\, 12 min\, shake at 6 -- OR a vegetable tray tossed in 1 tbsp
  oil + salt -> 400F\, ~15 min.\n\nWHILE THINGS COOK (hands busy\, nothing 
 to decide):\n4. Chop into 3 labeled containers: 3 onions\, 4 tomatoes\, gi
 nger-garlic for the week.\n5. Wash + stage Ahana's fruit for the week.\n6.
  Monday and Tuesday's exact dinners are already on next week's calendar ev
 ents — no grid to check. Just confirm this week's HEB list covers anythi
 ng missing for them.\n\nWHEN THE INSTANT POT RELEASES:\n7. Tempering (smal
 l pan): 2 tbsp ghee -> 1 tsp cumin seeds (sizzle) -> 4 cloves minced garli
 c + 1 chopped onion (golden) -> 2 chopped tomatoes + 1/2 tsp chili powder 
 + 1/2 tsp salt (soft) -> pour into dal\, mash lightly\, simmer 5 min.\n8. 
 AHANA FIRST: pull her portions from every pot BEFORE the tempering/final s
 alt goes in. Small containers\, labeled.\n\nASSEMBLE + CLOSE:\n9. 8 lunch 
 bowls: rice + dal (or chickpeas) + roasted veg/tofu. Yogurt + pickle added
  day-of by whoever's eating.\n10. Label leftovers with day tags. Wipe coun
 ters.\n11. Robot vacuum bin/mop pads — already its own line right before
  this\, same trip.\n\nBad week? Minimum viable = steps 1\, 2\, 8\, 9. Ever
 ything else skippable without guilt.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8c202409-d0c2-41cc-bae4-22c52773fb88@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T174500
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Weekly Reset
DESCRIPTION:15 min\, both of you: refill the pill organizer\, review the we
 ek's outliers\, scan next week's calendars for collisions\, confirm who ow
 ns Wednesday's refresh and which 2 mornings you take the 8-9 AM block.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dae89874-7178-4190-8dfa-909268a59f97@family-os
DTSTAMP:20260707T120000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T200000
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=SU
SUMMARY:Sunday evening — home day — Dinner: Simple Khichdi
DESCRIPTION:Deliberately unstructured — the anti-overscheduling day.\n\nD
 INNER TONIGHT (fixed\, no rotation — energy goes into the batch cook\, n
 ot a fancy dinner): 1 cup rice + 1/2 cup moong dal\, 4 cups water\, 1/2 ts
 p turmeric\, salt. Rice cooker\, or Instant Pot Manual 8 min. Serve with t
 oast or plain\, whichever's faster.\nAhana: her portion aside before any c
 hili.\n\nThen the daily evening rhythm (outdoor walk\, wind-down\, shutdow
 n ritual\, bedtime) picks up as usual at 8:00 PM.
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
